00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:43.960 line:20%
Sir,

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:45.720 line:20%
take care.

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:56.120 line:100%
I'm going.

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:22.000 line:100%
Why are you in such a hurry?

00:02:57.800 --> 00:02:58.920 line:100%
Wait.

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:02.040 line:100%
From what I remember, you never left.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:06.040 line:100%
Sir, you must be mistaken.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:08.560 line:100%
I've been teaching
in Beijing this whole time.

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:12.320 line:100%
Officer He.

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:15.320 line:100%
It's really you.

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:18.160 line:100%
Xiaohe, right?

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:21.480 line:100%
You don't recognize me?

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:24.760 line:100%
It's me. Qian Daqun.

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:26.680 line:100%
I used to be the property manager
at Yuanlongli.

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:28.640 line:100%
Now I'm just doing alright.

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:31.840 line:100%
I'm a deputy manager
for the new developer there.

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:34.960 line:100%
I'm handling Yuanlongli's
relocation project.

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:36.400 line:100%
What a coincidence.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:38.440 line:100%
Ran's back.

00:03:38.520 --> 00:03:40.080 line:100%
He's back too.

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:41.720 line:100%
Who?

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:43.560 line:100%
Mr. Qian, you must be busy.

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:45.280 line:100%
We won't hold you up.

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:46.480 line:100%
What do you mean by who?

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:48.120 line:100%
My apprentice, Ran Fangxu.

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:49.280 line:100%
You don't know him?

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:51.400 line:100%
Isn't Ran Fangxu already dead?

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:54.200 line:100%
What are you on about?

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:55.520 line:100%
Have you lost your mind?

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:57.040 line:100%
He's standing right here.

00:03:57.640 --> 00:03:59.000 line:100%
What kind of nonsense is that?

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:03.320 line:100%
I get it. Officer He,
you're messing with me, right?

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:05.840 line:100%
It's broad daylight.
You're not scaring me.

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:09.080 line:100%
Still, Officer Ran passed away so young.

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:11.080 line:100%
It's a real shame.

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:13.600 line:100%
Are you blind? Ran's right…

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:14.520 line:100%
WEIYANG STATION

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:18.240 line:100%
Ran?

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:21.680 line:100%
Ran Fangxu?

00:04:21.759 --> 00:04:23.280 line:100%
He was here.

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:26.880 line:100%
What's wrong with him? Has he gone senile?

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:29.800 line:100%
When Officer Ran died, it was brutal.
Even I know about that.

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:30.920 line:100%
-Stop talking.
-How could he not know?

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.760 line:100%
What did you say? Shut your trap!

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:33.760 line:100%
-Dad.
-Officer He.

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:35.320 line:100%
-What did you just say?
-Stop!

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:36.960 line:100%
Let's not argue with him. Mr. Qian.

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:38.320 line:100%
You should go.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:40.360 line:100%
-Dad.
-He must be senile.

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:42.960 line:100%
He Xiaohe, what's wrong with you?

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:44.920 line:100%
He kept saying Mr. Ran was dead.

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:46.040 line:100%
Didn't you hear him?

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:47.560 line:100%
You should've backed me up
and shut him down.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:48.680 line:100%
We should beat him up.

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:49.800 line:100%
Ran Fangxu.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:53.000 line:100%
Where are you? Ran Fangxu,

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:55.240 line:100%
-come out.
-Dad.

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:56.640 line:100%
I'll say it one more time. Stop hiding.

00:04:56.720 --> 00:04:57.840 line:100%
-Dad, listen to me.
-Let go.

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:00.920 line:100%
Ran Fangxu! Get out here!

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:01.880 line:100%
Dad.

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:03.000 line:100%
Don't stop me.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:05.440 line:100%
I'm going to the station right now
to pull the surveillance footage.

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:07.280 line:100%
I'll find out where he's hiding.

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:09.520 line:100%
Let go. Ran Fangxu!

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:10.520 line:100%
Get out here!

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.400 line:100%
-Dad.
-What are you doing?

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.160 line:100%
Let go.

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:15.240 line:100%
What are you doing?

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:17.040 line:100%
Ran Fangxu!

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.600 line:100%
Come out, Ran Fangxu!

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:20.160 line:100%
Where are you hiding, rascal?

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:21.320 line:100%
Get out here!

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:25.720 line:100%
-Did you hear me?
-Mr. Ran is already dead.

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:31.120 line:100%
What… What did you say?

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:38.200 line:100%
Mr. Ran has been dead.

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:44.160 line:100%
For twelve years.

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:56.320 line:100%
Young man, have you seen Ran?

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:58.240 line:100%
Ran Fangxu's holed up in the archives.

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:00.800 line:100%
He won't pick up his phone.

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:02.040 line:100%
Slacker.

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:04.000 line:100%
This is He.

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:11.840 line:100%
-Sir.
-What is that?

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:16.320 line:100%
Don't waste my time.

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:17.520 line:100%
Get out of the car.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:19.800 line:100%
Out now.

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:24.160 line:100%
Something's wrong with this place.

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:28.680 line:100%
Let go. I want to know
how I end up on that wall.

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:34.560 line:100%
Easy, easy.

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:37.360 line:100%
Ran!

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:39.920 line:100%
Ran!

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:43.600 line:100%
Ran!

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:47.320 line:100%
Hurry up.

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:49.960 line:100%
You're so clumsy.

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:01.840 line:100%
Stop playing dumb.

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:04.280 line:100%
Mr. He,

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:08.000 line:100%
it's time to let go.

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:09.720 line:100%
Dad.

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:11.720 line:100%
Don't dwell on the past.

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:15.680 line:100%
<i>Once we join hands, we are unstoppable.</i>

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:18.400 line:100%
Sir, just let it go.

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:21.120 line:100%
It's not worth spending your whole life
chasing one case.

00:07:21.720 --> 00:07:24.640 line:100%
<i>If you hadn't insisted on digging into it,</i>

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:27.240 line:100%
<i>who knows how many more lives</i>
<i>this cursed building would've taken?</i>

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:30.240 line:100%
He.

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:35.240 line:100%
Just let Ran go.

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:39.360 line:100%
<i>As your mentor, I'm ordering you</i>
<i>to stay in Weiyang.</i>

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:14.160 line:100%
<i>Sir, did you bring me here</i>
<i>to look for the kid?</i>

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:15.560 line:100%
<i>Or for something else?</i>

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:17.400 line:100%
<i>Why do you keep coming back to Yuanlongli?</i>

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:19.480 line:100%
<i>I can't keep an eye on him,</i>
<i>restrain him, or stop him.</i>

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:21.920 line:100%
<i>Sir, stop going to Yuanlongli.</i>

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.880 line:100%
<i>You're not to touch</i>
<i>the Yuanlongli case again.</i>

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:25.240 line:100%
<i>And you're not to go back there either.</i>

00:08:25.320 --> 00:08:28.040 line:100%
<i>You've brought me here again and again.</i>
<i>What exactly are you trying to do?</i>

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:28.960 line:100%
<i>Not even once more.</i>

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:31.120 line:100%
<i>You just want to keep me in Weiyang</i>

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:32.760 line:100%
<i>and pull me back into the case</i>
<i>from 18 years ago, don't you?</i>

00:08:32.839 --> 00:08:34.200 line:100%
-<i>And then what?</i>
-<i>Then,</i>

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:37.120 line:100%
<i>he stays in Weiyang and returns</i>
<i>to the Criminal Department.</i>

00:08:37.920 --> 00:08:39.599 line:100%
<i>Sir, stop going to Yuanlongli.</i>

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:41.520 line:100%
-<i>Just let Ran go.</i>
-<i>Stop dwelling on the past.</i>

00:08:41.599 --> 00:08:43.160 line:100%
<i>It's time to let go.</i>

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:45.160 line:100%
-<i>Stop going back there.</i>
-<i>Stop dwelling on the past.</i>

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:46.960 line:100%
<i>Sir, just let it go.</i>

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:48.400 line:100%
<i>I can't.</i>

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:56.720 line:100%
<i>Sir, I'm going.</i>

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:57.960 line:100%
<i>Take care.</i>

00:08:58.640 --> 00:08:59.840 line:100%
<i>Dad!</i>

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:06.640 line:100%
NO. 1 PEOPLE'S HOSPITAL

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:22.200 line:100%
CARDIOLOGY

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:27.320 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:29.640 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:37.680 line:100%
Why is Mr. He's episode
taking so long this time?

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:39.040 line:100%
He's even been hospitalized.

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:41.560 line:100%
He ran into a real case
at Yuanlongli this time.

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:43.640 line:100%
A real case?

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:51.000 line:100%
These past two years,
every time he thought he saw Mr. Ran,

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:52.560 line:100%
he'd drag him back
to Yuanlongli to investigate.

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:54.560 line:100%
I couldn't stop him.

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:57.000 line:100%
So I worked with everyone.

00:09:57.680 --> 00:09:59.800 line:100%
We staged a fake missing child case
to keep him occupied.

00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:03.040 line:100%
Ms. Feng, Ma Qiang, and Li Tieling.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.440 line:100%
They all helped me.

00:10:04.520 --> 00:10:06.160 line:100%
Once the child was found,

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:08.280 line:100%
we'd take Mr. Ran
to the train station and send him off.

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:10.120 line:100%
And my dad would snap out of it.

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:15.480 line:100%
We didn't expect
there to actually be a missing child

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:17.480 line:100%
in Yuanlongli this time.

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:19.440 line:100%
Things got out of our hands.

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:24.680 line:100%
At the station just now, Qian Dajun
insisted on saying Mr. Ran had already…

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:31.960 line:100%
Qian Dajun, seriously?

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:33.680 line:100%
Does he think before he speaks?

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:36.240 line:100%
Wasted everyone's time.

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:39.520 line:100%
The patient's awake. You can go in now.

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:43.400 line:100%
Dad,

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:45.320 line:100%
are you feeling any better?

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:49.440 line:100%
Mr. He, I'm Qiao.

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:51.520 line:100%
Are you alright?

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:54.120 line:100%
Mr. He, I'm Zhao Jie.

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:55.920 line:100%
The team is here to visit you.

00:11:07.440 --> 00:11:08.880 line:100%
He Yuanhang, are you clear-headed or not?

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:09.800 line:100%
Answer us.

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:12.960 line:100%
He,

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:15.760 line:100%
Captain Ran just called.

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:17.320 line:100%
He's arrived in Beijing.

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.640 line:100%
He told you not to worry.

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:19.960 line:100%
Yeah.

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:21.640 line:100%
Captain Ran heard you were hospitalized.

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:22.760 line:100%
He was worried sick.

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:24.200 line:100%
-He asked me to--
-Enough.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:28.240 line:100%
I remember everything now.

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:30.400 line:100%
Ran

00:11:31.240 --> 00:11:32.520 line:100%
is gone.

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:45.400 line:100%
The whole team has been going
along with this for over two years.

00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:49.320 line:100%
If it flares up again, no one can take it.

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:53.080 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:58.440 line:100%
In the first few years
after Captain Ran passed away,

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:00.160 line:100%
I used to dream about him all the time.

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:05.760 line:100%
Everyone on the force
who knew him missed him.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:08.120 line:100%
Right.

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.760 line:100%
Every time we hit a tough case, we think,

00:12:11.280 --> 00:12:12.600 line:100%
if only Captain Ran were still here.

00:12:12.680 --> 00:12:15.280 line:100%
But he's passed away for many years.

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:19.360 line:100%
He wouldn't want us
to sigh over him every day.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:21.240 line:100%
It's meaningless.

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:26.440 line:100%
Go back and talk to Mr. He.

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:28.000 line:100%
He needs to move on.

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:46.640 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:53.160 line:100%
I know a really good therapist.

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:55.600 line:100%
Take Mr. He to see him when you have time.

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:57.800 line:100%
TONG YUNKAI, PSYCHOLOGIST

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:21.000 line:100%
GET RICH

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:54.080 line:100%
<i>The Japan-Korea FIFA World Cup</i>
<i>is about to begin.</i>

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:56.000 line:100%
<i>China, making its first-ever</i>
<i>World Cup appearance,</i>

00:15:56.080 --> 00:16:00.160 line:100%
<i>has been drawn into Group C</i>
<i>with Brazil, Turkey, and Costa Rica.</i>

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:03.920 line:100%
<i>Let us look forward to a strong showing</i>
<i>from our national team.</i>

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:12.320 line:100%
WE ADVANCED
2002 KOREA-JAPAN FIFA WORLD CUP

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:19.880 line:100%
REFORM FOR GROWTH

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:21.320 line:100%
You're here, Officer He.

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:26.480 line:100%
Check the tire pressure. Top it up.

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:29.640 line:100%
You've been driving this junk for years.

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:31.600 line:100%
You're a deputy station chief now.

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:33.800 line:100%
Why won't you get a better car? Right?

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:35.240 line:100%
I don't have money.

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:37.280 line:100%
My daughter just started middle school.

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:38.800 line:100%
Everything costs money.

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:41.280 line:100%
Officer He,

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:42.920 line:100%
you and your wife have…

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:47.280 line:100%
Don't even start.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:48.480 line:100%
Hurry up. I have to fetch my girl.

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:52.360 line:100%
<i>They pass the ball like this…</i>
<i>Team China's special…</i>

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:57.280 line:100%
Pay up! Pay up! Pay up!

00:16:57.360 --> 00:16:59.160 line:100%
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY, WEIYANG CITY

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:02.200 line:100%
SAFETY ABOVE ALL

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:04.320 line:100%
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY

00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:06.320 line:100%
What's going on here?

00:17:06.879 --> 00:17:07.840 line:100%
They're demanding unpaid wages.

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:09.520 line:100%
Nothing new.

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:10.360 line:100%
PAY UP

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:13.119 line:100%
Since Wu became the factory director,

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:15.399 line:100%
business has gone downhill.

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:17.560 line:100%
It shut down last month.

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:20.560 line:100%
He owes the workers a year's pay.

00:17:20.639 --> 00:17:22.399 line:100%
-Where's Wu Shanlong?
-He's hiding.

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:25.560 line:100%
Anywhere there are women,
that's where he'll be.

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:28.000 line:100%
It's done.

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:31.240 line:100%
-Pay up!
-Pay up!

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:36.600 line:20%
SALARY, PAY UP

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:39.680 line:100%
-Pay up!
-Pay up!

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:42.280 line:100%
WU SHANLONG

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:53.560 line:100%
Senior, the problem with this case
is that the scene was washed clean

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:54.640 line:100%
by last night's heavy rain.

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:56.760 line:100%
No weapon or usable evidence
has been found.

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:58.040 line:100%
Officer Liu from Yangguan Branch.

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:00.400 line:100%
He called Captain Feng
and asked specifically for you to assist.

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:30.160 line:100%
POLICE

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:33.040 line:100%
-Hello.
-Hello.

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:34.360 line:100%
We're with Yangguan Branch.

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:36.600 line:100%
Hello. Nanshan Branch. Ran Fangxu.

00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:37.840 line:100%
Hello, Captain Ran. Nice to meet you.

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:41.920 line:100%
MENG FEI FEI

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:45.920 line:20%
PRICE LIST

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:56.280 line:100%
Most of the customers of this salon
are passing truck drivers.

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:57.520 line:100%
Last night, it was raining heavily.

00:18:57.600 --> 00:18:59.480 line:100%
Only the owner and two girls were inside.

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:01.480 line:100%
That gave the killer the perfect chance.

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:03.520 line:100%
There were two more victims inside.

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:32.640 line:100%
<i>It happened around 3 a.m.</i>

00:19:33.880 --> 00:19:35.360 line:100%
<i>Thunderstorm was at its peak.</i>

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:37.840 line:100%
<i>The killer used a blunt object</i>
<i>to strike the victims' heads</i>

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:39.240 line:100%
and killed all three women,

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:41.840 line:100%
then took the cash and jewelry.

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:44.280 line:100%
The murder weapon is still missing.

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:47.480 line:100%
Right.

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:50.280 line:100%
Before leaving, the killer
turned on every faucet

00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:51.640 line:100%
and left all the windows open.

00:19:51.720 --> 00:19:54.360 line:100%
The place was flooded inside and out.
The scene was thoroughly cleaned.

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:57.720 line:100%
Right now, we can't find anything usable.

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:05.680 line:100%
Thunderstorm. The fields are muddy.

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:06.680 line:100%
No one can get through.

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:09.200 line:100%
There are two cameras
about a kilometer apart along the highway.

00:20:09.280 --> 00:20:10.440 line:100%
We checked the footage.

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:11.560 line:100%
And guess what.

00:20:12.320 --> 00:20:14.360 line:100%
Because of the storm,
the road conditions were terrible.

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:16.200 line:100%
In the hour before and after the crime,

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:18.480 line:100%
not a single car,
not a single person passed.

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:21.080 line:100%
This is basically an impossible crime.

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:38.800 line:100%
MENG FEI FEI

00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:59.240 line:100%
Senior, did you find anything?

00:20:59.960 --> 00:21:02.240 line:100%
Zhao Jie, you're older than me.

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:03.800 line:100%
Don't call me senior.

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:05.320 line:100%
No way.

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:23.520 line:100%
What's Captain Ran doing?

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:25.920 line:100%
Is he here to solve the case
or just take a stroll?

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:29.360 line:100%
My senior works with creative thinking.

00:21:30.040 --> 00:21:32.560 line:100%
-If you want to learn, talk less.
-Alright.

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:36.440 line:100%
Oh my.

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:43.560 line:100%
Senior.

00:21:45.480 --> 00:21:46.640 line:100%
Zhao Jie.

00:22:13.080 --> 00:22:15.320 line:100%
This black raincoat
is missing a plastic button.

00:22:15.400 --> 00:22:16.960 line:100%
It matches the one in the victim's hand.

00:22:17.480 --> 00:22:19.960 line:100%
This was likely discarded by the suspect.

00:22:20.040 --> 00:22:21.600 line:100%
Right. This is it.

00:22:22.200 --> 00:22:25.000 line:100%
Captain Ran, how did you know
there'd be a clue here?

00:22:25.640 --> 00:22:27.080 line:100%
Complacency over distance.

00:22:27.160 --> 00:22:29.680 line:100%
The farther from the scene, the more
the suspect lets their guard down,

00:22:29.760 --> 00:22:30.840 line:100%
the easier they slip up.

00:22:31.440 --> 00:22:32.280 line:100%
It was raining heavily last night.

00:22:32.360 --> 00:22:33.920 line:100%
The killer had no choice
but to escape along the highway.

00:22:34.000 --> 00:22:36.360 line:100%
The farther they got, the safer they felt,

00:22:36.960 --> 00:22:39.560 line:100%
and the more eager they were
to get rid of that bloodstained raincoat.

00:22:40.240 --> 00:22:42.720 line:100%
He thought dumping it this far out
would keep it from being found.

00:22:42.800 --> 00:22:44.800 line:100%
But there are cameras all along the road.

00:22:44.880 --> 00:22:46.560 line:100%
How did none of them catch him?

00:22:49.840 --> 00:22:52.160 line:100%
Because the drainage ditch
is a blind spot.

00:22:53.240 --> 00:22:56.400 line:100%
The suspect likely parked
outside the camera range.

00:22:57.000 --> 00:23:00.040 line:100%
They walked along the ditch
to avoid detection,

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:02.840 line:100%
then circled back after the crime
and drove off.

00:23:02.920 --> 00:23:04.920 line:100%
That's why the cameras didn't pick him up.

00:23:05.720 --> 00:23:09.240 line:100%
Now all we need to do is check
the cameras at both ends of this road

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:11.520 line:100%
and look for vehicles that linger
or double back.

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:13.240 line:100%
That should lead us
straight to the suspect.

00:23:17.600 --> 00:23:18.520 line:100%
Convinced now?

00:23:23.480 --> 00:23:30.360 line:100%
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY BUREAU
NANSHAN BRANCH

00:23:30.440 --> 00:23:31.960 line:100%
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

00:23:39.760 --> 00:23:40.720 line:100%
Captain Feng.

00:23:41.440 --> 00:23:44.400 line:100%
Ran Fangxu, after this,

00:23:44.480 --> 00:23:46.560 line:100%
your reputation as a top detective
will be firmly established.

00:23:47.760 --> 00:23:50.040 line:100%
Yangguan Branch just called.

00:23:50.120 --> 00:23:52.480 line:100%
They've identified the suspect.

00:23:52.560 --> 00:23:53.440 line:100%
How long did that take?

00:23:53.520 --> 00:23:55.520 line:100%
Not even half a day.

00:23:58.320 --> 00:23:59.400 line:100%
Well done.

00:24:00.840 --> 00:24:02.760 line:100%
Everyone, not to brag,

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:05.120 line:100%
but the first time
I met Captain Ran, I had a feeling

00:24:05.200 --> 00:24:07.400 line:100%
he'd be the rising star in our force.

00:24:07.480 --> 00:24:09.200 line:100%
Don't hype me up.

00:24:09.280 --> 00:24:10.720 line:100%
As long as we catch the criminal,
that's enough.

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:12.360 line:100%
Those titles are over the top.

00:24:12.440 --> 00:24:13.760 line:100%
Not at all.

00:24:13.840 --> 00:24:14.840 line:100%
Stay grounded.

00:24:14.920 --> 00:24:16.200 line:100%
Keep up the good work.

00:24:16.280 --> 00:24:17.320 line:100%
Don't worry, Captain Feng.

00:24:21.400 --> 00:24:22.360 line:100%
Captain Ran,

00:24:22.440 --> 00:24:24.240 line:100%
you've always kept a low profile.

00:24:24.320 --> 00:24:25.920 line:100%
If it were He Yuanhang,

00:24:26.000 --> 00:24:27.560 line:100%
he'd have taken all the credit
straight to Director Zou.

00:24:27.640 --> 00:24:29.640 line:100%
Right? Here. Have some water.

00:24:30.480 --> 00:24:31.600 line:100%
Qu.

00:24:33.280 --> 00:24:36.440 line:100%
Why has He been avoiding me
all these years?

00:24:36.520 --> 00:24:37.800 line:100%
Any idea why?

00:24:38.320 --> 00:24:39.200 line:100%
What else could it be?

00:24:39.280 --> 00:24:40.680 line:100%
Jealousy, of course.

00:24:41.320 --> 00:24:43.520 line:100%
Back then, you two partnered up
and cracked that missing persons case,

00:24:43.600 --> 00:24:45.520 line:100%
then made a name in the mining case.

00:24:45.600 --> 00:24:47.520 line:100%
When he got back,
he was so full of himself.

00:24:47.600 --> 00:24:49.560 line:100%
His ego was through the roof.

00:24:50.160 --> 00:24:51.360 line:100%
Now look at things.

00:24:51.440 --> 00:24:53.200 line:100%
You've been promoted to deputy captain,

00:24:53.280 --> 00:24:55.040 line:100%
and he's still stuck where he is.

00:24:56.160 --> 00:24:58.000 line:100%
I heard he and his wife…

00:24:59.960 --> 00:25:01.760 line:100%
Fine. Forget it. Let's drop it.

00:25:18.080 --> 00:25:19.520 line:20%
THIEVES WILL BE PUNISHED

00:25:19.600 --> 00:25:21.880 line:20%
Cluck, cluck, cluck.

00:25:25.880 --> 00:25:27.360 line:100%
Red Crown.

00:25:31.880 --> 00:25:33.960 line:100%
Where did General White go?

00:25:39.880 --> 00:25:41.360 line:100%
General White?

00:25:44.040 --> 00:25:45.440 line:100%
General White.

00:25:52.200 --> 00:25:53.240 line:100%
General White.

00:25:54.520 --> 00:25:55.960 line:100%
General White.

00:26:03.560 --> 00:26:05.040 line:100%
General White.

00:26:17.120 --> 00:26:18.880 line:100%
Someone died!

00:26:18.960 --> 00:26:21.520 line:100%
Someone died!

00:27:39.680 --> 00:27:41.600 line:100%
<i>This old man's teeth</i>
<i>are quite distinctive.</i>

00:27:58.680 --> 00:28:00.280 line:100%
Hey, heard about that smuggling case?

00:28:00.360 --> 00:28:03.000 line:100%
-No luck. Haven't found it yet.
-Not yet?

00:28:03.080 --> 00:28:04.720 line:100%
-Officer He.
-Officer He, you're back.

00:28:04.800 --> 00:28:06.160 line:100%
Officer He, is that heavy?

00:28:06.240 --> 00:28:07.720 line:100%
Want me to carry that to my desk?

00:28:07.800 --> 00:28:08.680 line:100%
What are you on about?

00:28:08.760 --> 00:28:10.040 line:100%
You think they are all yours?

00:28:10.120 --> 00:28:13.840 line:100%
Same as always. Everyone has a share.

00:28:14.440 --> 00:28:16.000 line:100%
Look at you two.

00:28:16.080 --> 00:28:17.960 line:100%
The training site
was in the middle of nowhere.

00:28:18.040 --> 00:28:18.960 line:100%
Nothing to buy.

00:28:19.040 --> 00:28:20.920 line:100%
I just grabbed
some dried fish and shrimp paste.

00:28:21.560 --> 00:28:23.680 line:100%
-Where's Shouhu? Shouhu.
-Yes.

00:28:23.760 --> 00:28:24.720 line:100%
Come on. Quick.

00:28:24.800 --> 00:28:25.880 line:100%
Give these to everyone.

00:28:26.400 --> 00:28:27.760 line:100%
Officer He is back from training.

00:28:27.840 --> 00:28:29.440 line:100%
-Officer He is back.
-Officer He.

00:28:29.520 --> 00:28:30.480 line:100%
-Officer He.
-Officer He.

00:28:30.560 --> 00:28:32.040 line:100%
-Officer He.
-You're so thoughtful.

00:28:32.120 --> 00:28:33.520 line:100%
-Quite a lot!
-We have sent him

00:28:33.600 --> 00:28:35.200 line:100%
-whenever there is a training.
-It's mine.

00:28:35.280 --> 00:28:36.600 line:100%
-Officer He. You're back.
-Officer He said we share these.

00:28:36.680 --> 00:28:37.880 line:100%
-Yeah.
-Officer He said we share these.

00:28:37.960 --> 00:28:39.400 line:100%
-He didn't ask you to pick what you like.
-How was everything going?

00:28:39.480 --> 00:28:41.280 line:100%
Nothing unusual happened

00:28:41.360 --> 00:28:43.000 line:100%
while I was away, right?

00:28:43.080 --> 00:28:44.440 line:100%
All good. Nothing unusual.

00:28:44.520 --> 00:28:46.800 line:100%
-Good.
-Nothing unusual?

00:28:46.880 --> 00:28:48.000 line:100%
They found a skull in Yuanlongli.

00:28:49.360 --> 00:28:50.520 line:100%
Yuanlongli?

00:28:51.520 --> 00:28:52.600 line:100%
A skull?

00:28:52.680 --> 00:28:53.640 line:100%
Is that a murder case?

00:28:53.720 --> 00:28:54.920 line:100%
Here's the situation, Officer He.

00:28:55.000 --> 00:28:58.440 line:100%
Yesterday morning, a skull was found
on the rooftop of New York Block.

00:28:58.520 --> 00:29:01.880 line:100%
But the branch has taken over.
It's out of our hands.

00:29:04.400 --> 00:29:05.560 line:100%
What about Ran Fangxu?
Did he go check it out?

00:29:06.160 --> 00:29:07.000 line:100%
He did.

00:29:07.080 --> 00:29:09.840 line:100%
I think it's quite serious.

00:29:14.200 --> 00:29:14.920 line:100%
RAN

00:29:29.560 --> 00:29:33.120 line:100%
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

00:29:39.840 --> 00:29:41.880 line:100%
Officer He, what brings you here?

00:29:41.960 --> 00:29:43.280 line:100%
What's this?

00:29:43.360 --> 00:29:44.920 line:100%
Was it found in Yuanlongli?

00:29:45.000 --> 00:29:46.880 line:100%
It's related to the June 30th case
you worked on.

00:29:46.960 --> 00:29:48.560 line:100%
It's related? How?

00:29:52.360 --> 00:29:53.560 line:100%
We recovered hair samples
from the victim's home.

00:29:53.640 --> 00:29:56.520 line:100%
DNA comparison confirms
the skull belongs to Xu Zhihong.

00:29:59.320 --> 00:30:00.240 line:100%
Homicide?

00:30:00.840 --> 00:30:03.920 line:100%
A single skull isn't enough
to determine the cause of death.

00:30:04.000 --> 00:30:05.400 line:100%
But look at this.

00:30:05.920 --> 00:30:08.520 line:100%
There's a fracture
at the back of the skull.

00:30:08.600 --> 00:30:10.960 line:100%
Uneven edges. Dark red coloration.

00:30:14.600 --> 00:30:15.680 line:100%
That suggests a blunt impact

00:30:15.760 --> 00:30:16.880 line:100%
to the back of the head
while the victim was alive.

00:30:16.960 --> 00:30:18.320 line:100%
And with bleeding.

00:30:20.000 --> 00:30:21.480 line:100%
Here.

00:30:21.560 --> 00:30:24.400 line:100%
A linear cut
on the lower right rear of the skull.

00:30:24.480 --> 00:30:25.560 line:100%
Deep to the bone.

00:30:26.200 --> 00:30:28.400 line:100%
Clean edges. No vital reaction.

00:30:28.480 --> 00:30:31.120 line:100%
That cut was made after death,
likely during dismemberment.

00:30:32.080 --> 00:30:33.680 line:100%
High probability of homicide.

00:30:36.320 --> 00:30:37.240 line:100%
Time of death?

00:30:37.840 --> 00:30:40.240 line:100%
About five years ago. 1997.

00:30:55.280 --> 00:30:56.400 line:100%
Where's he?

00:30:57.000 --> 00:30:58.640 line:100%
He's not answering his phone.

00:31:01.440 --> 00:31:03.640 line:100%
Alright. Got it.

00:31:07.200 --> 00:31:08.040 line:100%
Captain Feng.

00:31:10.520 --> 00:31:14.120 line:100%
REFLECTION REPORT ON YUANLONGLI
JUNE 30TH CASE. HE YUANHANG

00:31:16.240 --> 00:31:17.440 line:100%
What's this?

00:31:21.240 --> 00:31:22.400 line:100%
Captain Feng,

00:31:23.080 --> 00:31:24.400 line:100%
the Yuanlongli case

00:31:24.480 --> 00:31:25.880 line:100%
has now gone
from missing persons to homicide.

00:31:27.560 --> 00:31:30.000 line:100%
Ran and I made a mistake.

00:31:30.520 --> 00:31:32.040 line:100%
But I need to make one thing clear.

00:31:32.640 --> 00:31:35.200 line:100%
Back then, I was leading
the investigation.

00:31:35.280 --> 00:31:38.000 line:100%
-This has nothing to do with Ran.
-He Yuanhang.

00:31:38.880 --> 00:31:40.480 line:100%
That's not how you cover
for your apprentice.

00:31:41.160 --> 00:31:42.520 line:100%
In the case summary,

00:31:42.600 --> 00:31:45.080 line:100%
Ran Fangxu's name was listed before yours.

00:31:45.160 --> 00:31:48.440 line:100%
That alone puts
primary responsibility on him.

00:31:49.120 --> 00:31:50.560 line:100%
I was being humble.

00:31:50.640 --> 00:31:52.200 line:100%
I put his name first on purpose.

00:31:52.800 --> 00:31:55.640 line:100%
He was a fresh graduate. What did he know?

00:31:55.720 --> 00:31:56.920 line:100%
He knew nothing.

00:31:57.000 --> 00:32:00.360 line:100%
Captain Feng,
I request disciplinary action.

00:32:01.200 --> 00:32:02.960 line:100%
Is this about discipline?

00:32:03.640 --> 00:32:05.520 line:100%
You think this isn't embarrassing enough?

00:32:08.840 --> 00:32:09.920 line:100%
PERSONNEL TRANSFER APPLICATION FORM

00:32:12.720 --> 00:32:13.760 line:100%
What is this again?

00:32:13.840 --> 00:32:16.800 line:100%
Can you second me here again?

00:32:16.880 --> 00:32:18.880 line:100%
Assign me full-time to this case.

00:32:18.960 --> 00:32:21.200 line:100%
I guarantee, in…

00:32:21.720 --> 00:32:23.080 line:100%
in one week,

00:32:23.160 --> 00:32:24.240 line:100%
I'll crack it.

00:32:24.320 --> 00:32:27.720 line:100%
-Then…
-Then you mess it up again?

00:32:28.320 --> 00:32:29.160 line:100%
No, I…

00:32:29.240 --> 00:32:32.680 line:100%
Captain Feng, I want to get rid
of this stupid brat for good.

00:32:32.760 --> 00:32:34.280 line:100%
He Yuanhang.

00:32:35.120 --> 00:32:37.080 line:100%
You're late for that.

00:32:37.160 --> 00:32:42.160 line:100%
Since the skull was found,
that brat hasn't left Yuanlongli.

00:32:42.240 --> 00:32:44.640 line:100%
He's not even answering my calls.

00:32:52.480 --> 00:32:56.120 line:100%
A smooth road
never makes a great detective.

00:32:57.320 --> 00:33:01.920 line:100%
Let's consider this case a test for him.

00:33:04.240 --> 00:33:05.160 line:100%
Point taken.

00:33:06.720 --> 00:33:10.200 line:100%
That's why you're the boss.

00:33:13.080 --> 00:33:14.000 line:100%
And this…

00:33:14.080 --> 00:33:16.000 line:100%
PERSONNEL TRANSFER APPLICATION FORM

00:33:17.680 --> 00:33:19.240 line:100%
I'm not signing that.

00:33:20.120 --> 00:33:22.960 line:100%
Even if I bring you here,
you'll just try to leave again

00:33:23.040 --> 00:33:25.080 line:100%
-in a few days.
-No, not at this time.

00:33:25.160 --> 00:33:26.600 line:100%
If I don't crack this case,

00:33:26.680 --> 00:33:27.920 line:100%
I won't leave even
if you beat me to death.

00:33:29.120 --> 00:33:30.200 line:100%
I mean it.

00:33:32.440 --> 00:33:35.000 line:100%
The submission process is all wrong.

00:33:35.080 --> 00:33:36.320 line:100%
Leave the form here. I'll handle it.

00:33:37.560 --> 00:33:40.960 line:100%
This time, we'll push him again.

00:33:41.040 --> 00:33:43.520 line:100%
He has to get back up where he fell.

00:33:44.360 --> 00:33:45.320 line:100%
One day,

00:33:45.400 --> 00:33:49.800 line:100%
when he takes this seat, he'll win
everyone's hearts and minds.

00:33:50.480 --> 00:33:51.800 line:100%
I'll make sure of it.

00:33:56.640 --> 00:34:02.160 line:100%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:34:15.160 --> 00:34:17.160 line:100%
How am I supposed to interfere
with a police investigation?

00:34:17.240 --> 00:34:18.760 line:100%
-But you should do something!
-Yes!

00:34:18.840 --> 00:34:22.320 line:100%
Officer He, could you go talk
to Officer Ran?

00:34:22.999 --> 00:34:25.880 line:100%
-What's going on with Ran Fangxu?
-He's lost it.

00:34:25.959 --> 00:34:27.600 line:100%
Since yesterday,

00:34:27.680 --> 00:34:29.640 line:100%
he's dug up everything
from downstairs to the rooftop.

00:34:30.320 --> 00:34:32.519 line:100%
Even the parking garage
and outside the compound.

00:34:34.080 --> 00:34:35.280 line:100%
Where is he? Where is he now?

00:34:36.120 --> 00:34:37.280 line:100%
Still on the roof, I think.

00:35:01.080 --> 00:35:02.080 line:100%
Ran Fangxu!

00:35:04.120 --> 00:35:05.440 line:100%
Ran Fangxu.

00:35:09.320 --> 00:35:11.160 line:100%
Ran Fangxu. Stop.

00:35:12.240 --> 00:35:14.080 line:100%
I said stop. Did you hear me?

00:35:15.800 --> 00:35:17.080 line:100%
This isn't investigating.

00:35:17.160 --> 00:35:18.840 line:100%
This is vandalism.

00:35:20.800 --> 00:35:23.400 line:100%
Stop. Stop it. Did you hear me?

00:35:24.680 --> 00:35:26.560 line:100%
What's wrong with you?

00:35:34.400 --> 00:35:35.800 line:100%
It's approved.

00:35:36.400 --> 00:35:38.480 line:100%
We're partnering up again.

00:35:38.560 --> 00:35:41.480 line:100%
We cracked this case five years ago.

00:35:41.560 --> 00:35:43.840 line:100%
We can crack it again now.

00:35:46.120 --> 00:35:48.440 line:100%
But Xu Meng and her dad
aren't coming back.

00:35:52.120 --> 00:35:53.160 line:100%
Five years ago,

00:35:54.360 --> 00:35:56.000 line:100%
they went through so much

00:35:56.640 --> 00:35:58.480 line:100%
to make themselves disappear

00:35:59.000 --> 00:36:00.920 line:100%
just to stay alive.

00:36:01.600 --> 00:36:02.680 line:100%
And in the end…

00:36:07.880 --> 00:36:10.520 line:100%
If I hadn't rushed to a conclusion,

00:36:12.600 --> 00:36:13.960 line:100%
if I'd kept digging,

00:36:16.520 --> 00:36:18.200 line:100%
maybe they wouldn't have died.

00:36:21.520 --> 00:36:23.480 line:100%
Stop thinking that way, please.

00:36:23.560 --> 00:36:25.920 line:100%
You can't solve cases based on "ifs".

00:36:26.000 --> 00:36:28.400 line:100%
Right now, we need to find the killer.

00:36:28.480 --> 00:36:30.600 line:100%
Even if we do,

00:36:32.520 --> 00:36:34.160 line:100%
it won't bring them back.

00:36:35.720 --> 00:36:38.360 line:100%
Ran Fangxu, snap out of it already.

00:36:38.440 --> 00:36:40.760 line:100%
Now, we've found Xu Zhihong is dead.

00:36:40.840 --> 00:36:42.760 line:100%
We don't know
whether Xu Meng is dead or alive.

00:36:42.840 --> 00:36:45.360 line:100%
We must look into the case again.
She might still be alive.

00:36:47.360 --> 00:36:48.320 line:100%
No, she's not.

00:36:48.960 --> 00:36:49.920 line:100%
No.

00:36:51.480 --> 00:36:53.360 line:100%
I've studied enough missing persons cases.

00:36:55.000 --> 00:36:56.640 line:100%
Xu Meng wouldn't have survived.

00:37:00.040 --> 00:37:02.680 line:100%
My parents went missing together.

00:37:06.800 --> 00:37:08.320 line:100%
When I was in the academy,

00:37:08.400 --> 00:37:12.120 line:100%
I swore I would solve
every missing persons case I took.

00:37:12.200 --> 00:37:13.240 line:100%
But…

00:37:14.120 --> 00:37:15.680 line:100%
Now… My first case…

00:37:37.920 --> 00:37:39.640 line:100%
I failed Xu Meng and her dad.

00:37:42.760 --> 00:37:44.400 line:100%
<i>I failed my parents too.</i>

00:37:52.520 --> 00:37:53.440 line:100%
Ran.

00:37:53.520 --> 00:37:54.800 line:100%
Did you kill them?

00:37:56.040 --> 00:37:59.600 line:100%
No, you didn't. Then stop wasting time
and stop crying over spilled milk.

00:37:59.680 --> 00:38:02.000 line:100%
Let's move and bring
the killer to justice.

00:38:02.080 --> 00:38:03.400 line:100%
That's how you honor them

00:38:03.480 --> 00:38:05.360 line:100%
and your own oath.

00:38:06.680 --> 00:38:08.760 line:100%
Xu Zhihong's been dead for five years.

00:38:10.800 --> 00:38:14.720 line:100%
We had no leads back then.
How do we investigate now?

00:38:14.800 --> 00:38:16.440 line:100%
How do we catch the killer?

00:38:16.960 --> 00:38:17.880 line:100%
This case

00:38:19.120 --> 00:38:20.320 line:100%
is unsolvable.

00:38:21.000 --> 00:38:22.440 line:100%
What did you just say?

00:38:23.200 --> 00:38:26.040 line:100%
I've never once asked
the captain for favors.

00:38:26.120 --> 00:38:28.080 line:100%
This time, I fought to get assigned here,

00:38:28.680 --> 00:38:31.320 line:100%
and you're hiding out,
telling me you can't solve it?

00:38:34.160 --> 00:38:35.000 line:100%
My fault.

00:38:40.120 --> 00:38:41.120 line:100%
It's all my fault.

00:38:42.720 --> 00:38:44.400 line:100%
I don't deserve to be a detective.

00:38:45.080 --> 00:38:46.440 line:100%
Then what?

00:38:49.840 --> 00:38:50.800 line:100%
I'm going back to Beijing

00:38:52.200 --> 00:38:53.680 line:100%
to be a lecturer.

00:38:53.760 --> 00:38:54.760 line:100%
Cut the nonsense.

00:38:54.840 --> 00:38:56.040 line:100%
Let's go. We're working the case now.

00:38:56.120 --> 00:38:57.640 line:100%
Come on. Are you coming or not?

00:38:59.320 --> 00:39:00.840 line:100%
Are you coming or not?
Are you coming or not?

00:39:05.680 --> 00:39:06.920 line:100%
Not coming?

00:39:07.440 --> 00:39:08.280 line:100%
Fine.

00:39:09.360 --> 00:39:10.200 line:100%
If you won't do it,

00:39:12.680 --> 00:39:14.640 line:100%
I will.

00:39:18.160 --> 00:39:19.720 line:100%
You are a coward.

00:39:28.160 --> 00:39:29.400 line:100%
I'll crack it on my own.

00:39:36.720 --> 00:39:37.640 line:100%
He?

00:39:43.080 --> 00:39:44.080 line:100%
He.

00:39:47.920 --> 00:39:49.080 line:100%
He.

00:39:52.480 --> 00:39:53.320 line:100%
He!

00:39:53.400 --> 00:39:54.680 line:100%
He!

00:40:02.200 --> 00:40:03.320 line:100%
He!

00:40:03.960 --> 00:40:05.000 line:100%
He!

00:40:08.360 --> 00:40:09.600 line:100%
He!